{"attempt_id": "warmup:WQ-3bfe77f877cce257a0df51da:QI-edd6732f115cc54df09d", "capture_schema_version": "math-fast-intake-capture-v2", "content_hash": "c2b4d8f3c5af29794ceab977467a75eb113fcbae6a8ba0aca8f22db545a60b77", "episode_evidence": {"solution_text": "记 P=(4x-y)/(4x^2+y^2)，Q=(x+y)/(4x^2+y^2)。原点位于 L 围成的区域内，且 4x^2+y^2 在原点为 0，因此不能直接在整个圆盘上使用格林公式。在原点外计算得 Q_x-P_y=0。\n\n取足够小的内椭圆 l：4x^2+y^2=sigma^2，并令 l 作为挖洞区域的顺时针内边界，则 L+l 是无奇点区域 D 的正向边界。由格林公式，L+l 上的曲线积分为 0，所以原外边界 L 上的积分等于逆时针小椭圆 -l 上的积分。\n\n在 -l 上分母恒为 sigma^2，因此积分化为 (1/sigma^2) 乘以 (4x-y)dx+(x+y)dy 在 -l 上的积分。对光滑系数 4x-y 与 x+y 使用格林公式，旋度为 1-(-1)=2。椭圆 4x^2+y^2=sigma^2 的半轴分别为 sigma/2 与 sigma，面积为 pi*sigma^2/2。因此小椭圆积分等于 pi，原积分也等于 pi。", "teaching_turns": [{"kind": "reasoning", "origin": "user_observed", "speaker": "user", "text": "闭曲线先用格林公式；偏导中把 4x 乘 2y 写成 4xy，最终写成 0。"}, {"kind": "explanation", "origin": "assistant_explained", "speaker": "assistant", "text": "先检查分母零点；原点是内部奇点，需挖去小椭圆，并把外边界积分转移到逆时针小椭圆。"}, {"kind": "restatement", "origin": "user_confirmed", "speaker": "user", "text": "选择 4x^2+y^2=sigma^2 后分母恒定；先把椭圆面积当成圆面积，随后自行改用 pi*a*b 并得到 pi。"}], "user_answer_text": "最初看到闭曲线后直接对整个圆盘使用格林公式；计算 P 对 y 的偏导时把 4x 乘 2y 误写成 4xy，没有发现 Q_x=P_y，并将结果写成 0。经过条件检查后确认原点是内部奇点，需要挖洞；随后选择 4x^2+y^2=sigma^2，使小椭圆上分母恒定。计算小椭圆面积时先误用圆面积 pi*sigma^2，得到 2pi，随后自行发现该曲线是椭圆，改用 pi*a*b，得到 pi。"}, "event_id": "MFI-CAP-7a8efd7015c1374020f9a16b", "event_type": "capture", "evidence": {"first_break": {"kind": "condition", "origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "使用格林公式前没有检查 4x^2+y^2=0 的点，因而遗漏了积分区域内部的原点奇点。"}, "hints_needed": [{"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "需要讲解格林公式的连续性条件、挖洞后的内外边界方向，以及将外圈积分转移到小椭圆的步骤。"}], "independent_correct_steps": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "用户最初正确写出格林公式中的偏导顺序为 Q_x-P_y。"}], "later_breaks": [{"kind": "calculation", "origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "计算 P_y 时把 4x 乘 2y 错写为 4xy，未得到与 Q_x 相同的 -8xy 项。"}, {"kind": "concept", "origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "计算 4x^2+y^2=sigma^2 所围面积时先将椭圆当成圆，误用 pi*r^2。"}], "mastery_score": 1, "mastery_source": "warmup_score", "result": "wrong", "score_basis": {"origin": "source_verified", "text": "已记录评分事件 SCORE-21aaf429f2360b46db5a2269；原始闭卷作答遗漏奇点条件、偏导计算错误且最终结果错误。"}, "self_corrections": [{"origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "用户自行确认 P_y 中应出现 -8xy，并认识到 Q_x=P_y。"}, {"origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "用户自行发现 4x^2+y^2=sigma^2 是椭圆而非圆，改用半轴 sigma/2 与 sigma 的面积公式。"}], "unresolved": [], "user_facts": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "用户最初直接对包含原点的整个圆盘使用格林公式，并给出最终结果 0。"}, {"origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "用户确认计算 P_y 时把 4x 乘 2y 误写成 4xy，而正确乘积为 8xy。"}, {"origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "用户随后确认原点是内部奇点，并采用 4x^2+y^2=sigma^2 的小椭圆挖洞。"}, {"origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "用户先把小椭圆面积误算为 pi*sigma^2，随后自行改用椭圆面积 pi*a*b。"}]}, "idempotency_key": "7a8efd7015c1374020f9a16b748b867a135df2a5e3dc9cfe3136c6b2a611767f", "initial_state": "pending_nightly", "payload_hash": "33cb8b6d68ba199b84452f034fa04bedb7e6e4af309534b0fe3a77297e9b9c30", "recorded_at": "2026-08-25T11:30:31+08:00", "requested_action": "record_recurrence", "schema_version": "math-fast-intake-ledger-v1", "score_ref": {"anchor_card_id": "GS-694", "attempt_id": "warmup:WQ-3bfe77f877cce257a0df51da:QI-edd6732f115cc54df09d", "event_id": "SCORE-21aaf429f2360b46db5a2269", "formal_id": "GS-709", "match_mode": "knowledge_fallback", "queue_id": "WQ-3bfe77f877cce257a0df51da", "queue_item_id": "QI-edd6732f115cc54df09d", "score": 1, "source_version": "f4aaf177872cf49480edd334dba5f933a067b07efd5d1cd30455840f50e71ef6", "study_date": "2026-08-25"}, "source_bundle": {"manifest_hash": "24b756e0eb2cacf5a63923bbe992ac7acdadc43241a51e6295b18d4bbd6b0a7c", "manifest_path": "数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-25/eefaafa05fd3b4eaf87e3975/manifest.json", "source_locator": "warmup:WQ-3bfe77f877cce257a0df51da:QI-edd6732f115cc54df09d:GS-709", "study_date": "2026-08-25"}, "study_date": "2026-08-25", "target": {"formal_id": "GS-709", "identity_state": "verified_score_delivery", "kind": "formal_card", "source_hash_before": "f4aaf177872cf49480edd334dba5f933a067b07efd5d1c